# Q.af Inline-Style Migration Session

Session: 2026-06-28 — Batch rewrite of dashboard components from legacy CSS classes to zero-CSS-footprint inline styles.

## Context
The project uses Tailwind CSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/postcss` in `postcss.config.mjs`), but many dashboard client components were written before Tailwind with custom `.btn`, `.card`, `.surface`, `.toolbar`, `.table`, `.modal-backdrop`, etc. classes defined in `src/app/globals.css`. The goal is to eliminate all legacy CSS classes and replace them with inline styles, making components portable and the stylesheet lean.

## Files migrated (chronological order)

### Wave 1 — Shell + wrappers
1. `src/components/SidebarLayout.tsx` — full rewrite (15,225 → ~15,000 chars). Glass-morphism sidebar, sticky topbar, emoji icons, CSS variable theming.
2. `src/app/dashboard/links/page.tsx` — thin wrapper, design-system PageHeader.
3. `src/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx` — thin wrapper.
4. `src/app/dashboard/bio/page.tsx` — thin wrapper.

### Wave 2 — Queue system
5. `src/app/dashboard/queue/page.tsx` — manager overview.
6. `src/app/dashboard/queue/QueueBoardClient.tsx` — ticket board (12,370 → 276 lines inline).
7. `src/app/dashboard/queue/employee/page.tsx` — employee console gate.
8. `src/app/dashboard/queue/employee/EmployeeConsole.tsx` — counter console.
9. `src/app/dashboard/queue/employee/EmployeePinForm.tsx` — PIN entry.
10. `src/app/dashboard/queue/scanner/page.tsx` — scanner gate.
11. `src/app/dashboard/queue/scanner/ScannerClient.tsx` — barcode/QR scanner.
12. `src/app/dashboard/queue/settings/page.tsx` — settings gate.
13. `src/app/dashboard/queue/settings/QueueSettingsClient.tsx` — queue + employee CRUD.

### Wave 3 — QR / NFC / Code generation
14. `src/app/dashboard/qr/page.tsx` — wrapper.
15. `src/app/dashboard/qr/CodeGeneratorClient.tsx` — 7 symbology generator (10,434 → 15,816 chars, all inline).
16. `src/app/dashboard/qr/design/page.tsx` — wrapper.
17. `src/app/dashboard/qr/design/QRDesignClient.tsx` — preset list + live preview (12,814 → 14,530 chars).
18. `src/app/dashboard/qr/nfc/page.tsx` — wrapper.
19. `src/app/dashboard/qr/nfc/NFCClient.tsx` — NFC tag manager (11,388 → 12,345 chars).

### Wave 4 — Simple server pages
20. `src/app/dashboard/api-keys/page.tsx`
21. `src/app/dashboard/ab/page.tsx`
22. `src/app/dashboard/payments/page.tsx`
23. `src/app/dashboard/webhooks/page.tsx`
24. `src/app/dashboard/team/page.tsx`

## Files NOT yet migrated (remaining legacy CSS consumers)

