| `AnalyticsClient.tsx` | ~18.8KB | Tailwind `q-*` utility classes + custom `Shell` wrapping `SidebarLayout` |
| `AgencyClient.tsx` | ~8KB | (unknown, grep needed) |
| `BioListClient.tsx` | ~8KB | (unknown, grep needed) |
| `BioEditorClient.tsx` | ~9KB | (unknown, grep needed) |

