# Phase 12 — Stunning UI/UX Design System

**When**: The dashboard is functionally complete but visually still feels "amateur" — emoji icons in nav, no dark mode, no command palette, generic Tailwind cards, slow-render tables, no micro-interactions. Goal: ship a Linear / Vercel / Stripe-quality dashboard without redesigning every page.

**Strategy**: Build a **token-based design system** + a small library of **generic components** (Kpi, CountUp, Skeleton, Topbar, ThemeToggle, CommandPalette, LanguageSwitcher, NotificationCenter). Apply the system to the root layout and the dashboard home page first; remaining pages inherit the same look by using the same utility classes.

