## 2. Regional multi-currency pricing table

Show the same three plans in 8 MENA currencies (or however many you support)
without a rate API dependency. The base plan price is in one currency (SAR
on Q.af); the table multiplies by hardcoded reference rates updated daily in
production.

**Component (`src/components/RegionalPricingTable.tsx` — server component):**

```tsx
type Cur = { code: string; symbol: string; rate: number; name: string; flag: string; decimals: number };

const CURRENCIES: Cur[] = [
  { code: "SAR", symbol: "ر.س", rate: 1,     name: "السعودية", flag: "🇸🇦", decimals: 0 },
  { code: "AED", symbol: "د.إ", rate: 0.98,  name: "الإمارات", flag: "🇦🇪", decimals: 0 },
  { code: "EGP", symbol: "ج.م", rate: 12.65, name: "مصر",      flag: "🇪🇬", decimals: 0 },
  { code: "JOD", symbol: "د.أ", rate: 0.19,  name: "الأردن",   flag: "🇯🇴", decimals: 2 },
  { code: "KWD", symbol: "د.ك", rate: 0.082, name: "الكويت",   flag: "🇰🇼", decimals: 2 },
  { code: "BHD", symbol: "د.ب", rate: 0.10,  name: "البحرين",  flag: "🇧🇭", decimals: 2 },
  { code: "QAR", symbol: "ر.ق", rate: 0.97,  name: "قطر",      flag: "🇶🇦", decimals: 0 },
  { code: "OMR", symbol: "ر.ع", rate: 0.10,  name: "عُمان",    flag: "🇴🇲", decimals: 2 },
];

const PLANS = [
  { id: "starter",  name: "Starter",  sar: 0,  featured: false },
  { id: "pro",      name: "Pro",      sar: 29, featured: true  },
  { id: "business", name: "Business", sar: 99, featured: false },
];

// Decimal handling: KWD/JOD/OMR/BHD use 2 decimals, SAR/AED/EGP/QAR use 0
function fmt(v: number, dec: number) {
  const s = v.toFixed(dec);
  return s.includes(".") ? s.replace(/0+$/, "").replace(/\.$/, "") : s;
}

export default function RegionalPricingTable() {
  return (
    <section className="pricing-regional">
      <h2>الأسعار حسب المنطقة</h2>
      <p className="pricing-regional-note">
        أسعارنا الأساسية بالريال السعودي، ونعرضها بعملتك المحلية بأسعار الصرف المرجعية.
      </p>
      <div className="regional-table-wrap">
        <table className="regional-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>الخطة / الدولة</th>
              {CURRENCIES.map((c) => (
                <th key={c.code}>
                  <span className="flag">{c.flag}</span>
                  <br /><span className="cur-code">{c.code}</span>
                  <br /><span className="cur-name">{c.name}</span>
                </th>
              ))}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {PLANS.map((p) => (
              <tr key={p.id} className={p.featured ? "featured-row" : undefined}>
                <th className={p.featured ? "featured-col" : undefined}>{p.name}</th>
                {CURRENCIES.map((c) => {
                  const local = p.sar * c.rate;
                  const text = local === 0 ? "مجاناً" : `${fmt(local, c.decimals)} ${c.symbol}`;
                  return (
                    <td key={c.code} className={p.featured ? "featured-col" : undefined}>{text}</td>
                  );
                })}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p className="pricing-regional-foot">
        * يتم تحديث أسعار الصرف يومياً. تُحصَّل الرسوم عبر بوابات الدفع المحلية (mada، KNET، fawry…).
      </p>
    </section>
  );
}
```

**Decimal rules per currency — critical for correctness:**
- 0 decimals: SAR, AED, EGP, QAR (large nominal values, no fractional typical)
- 2 decimals: KWD, JOD, BHD, OMR (small nominal values, precision matters)
- The `fmt()` function trims trailing zeros so `28.00` becomes `28` (cleaner display).

**CSS responsive wrap:**

```css
.regional-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid #ece6ff; }
.regional-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 760px; font-size: 13px; }
.regional-table thead th {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f0ff, #eafcff);
  color: #4a3a8a; font-weight: 700; padding: 16px 8px;
}
.regional-table .featured-col {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(111,44,255,.04), rgba(0,194,255,.04));
  color: #6f2cff; font-weight: 700;
}
```

