## DataTable Sorting Gotcha

The `DataTable` component uses `useState` for sort key/direction. When columns declare `sortable: true`, the component automatically handles ascending/descending toggle. Ensure the `key` matches the property name in the row object for primitive sorting. For custom `render` columns, sorting falls back to the raw row value (which may be an object) — either implement custom sort in the parent or make the `key` correspond to a primitive field.

## StatsCard Grid Responsiveness

Use `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr))` for the stats grid. This auto-wraps cards on narrow viewports without media queries. The `gap: 16` provides consistent spacing.

